","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T13:28:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T13:29:19Z","body":"> Hello! May I ask if you could print the name of the controllers? print(Input.get_joy_name(0))\n\nAlso already added in the report above ;)\n\n> Edit: As requested in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814, here are the GUIDs:\nJoy-Con (L) => 050067007e0500000620000001800000\nJoy-Con (R) => 05006ea07e0500000720000001800000\n\nEdit: Oh, I just saw it in the other issus, it is a different command, my bad, will do.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564417704/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564615670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4564615670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4564615670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBKB9g","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T13:46:04Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T13:51:44Z","body":"Here are the infos:\n```\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Joy-Con (L)\", \"vendor_id\": \"1406\", \"product_id\": \"8198\", \"xinput_index\": \"0\" }\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Joy-Con (R)\", \"vendor_id\": \"1406\", \"product_id\": \"8199\", \"xinput_index\": \"0\" }\n```\n\nOh, guess I used `info` instead of `name`...\n\nSo here are the names:\n```\nNintendo Switch Left Joy-Con\nNintendo Switch Right Joy-Con\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564615670/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564882333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4564882333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4564882333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBaTnQ","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:12:23Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T14:12:23Z","body":"It looks like there are conflicting mappings that gets used by Godot. Here are the ones from `gamecontrollerdb.txt` and the ones that get used for your controllers:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e82870e250a326c94e03d658306db94e1b116c2d/core/input/gamecontrollerdb.txt#L1541\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e82870e250a326c94e03d658306db94e1b116c2d/core/input/gamecontrollerdb.txt#L1546\nHere are the ones that should get used, these ones are from SDL's internal database:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e82870e250a326c94e03d658306db94e1b116c2d/thirdparty/sdl/joystick/SDL_gamepad_db.h#L652\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e82870e250a326c94e03d658306db94e1b116c2d/thirdparty/sdl/joystick/SDL_gamepad_db.h#L655\n\nAlthough they're mostly the same, so changing the mapping might break something. I think we should create our mappings and present them to SDL developers, they can check whether the mappings are acceptable. If not, in that case that might be a driver or a hardware issue.\nWhat do you think?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564882333/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565180870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4565180870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4565180870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBshxg","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:38:55Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T14:38:55Z","body":"Sounds good, I'll see when I can get to create a mapping.\n\nAcoording to your experience, does it make a difference who reports/suggests it to SDL (like in me vs someone from the Godot team)?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565180870/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565228659","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4565228659","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4565228659,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBvccw","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:44:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T14:44:01Z","body":"From my experience, I think SDL developers are very cooperative with any person, whether that's from Godot team or not, so I think it doesn't make much difference! :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565228659/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565299244","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4565299244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4565299244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBzwLA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:49:46Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T14:50:39Z","body":"I should also mention that L, R, ZL, and ZR buttons in the horizontal/mini gamepad mode for JoyCons should be mapped as paddles, since that's how they're mapped in the HIDAPI joystick driver for JoyCons. You can map the paddles in testcontroller by clicking on their text in the app and pressing a button on the controller.\n\n<img width=\"310\" height=\"511\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19e4a94b-f1df-45c2-9db4-9b42e6c20c48\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565299244/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4606539300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4606539300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4606539300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEpI2JA","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T20:00:02Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T20:00:02Z","body":"Joy-Con (L)\n```\n050067007e0500000620000001800000,Nintendo Switch Joy-Con (L),crc:0067,platform:Linux,a:b9,b:b8,back:b5,guide:b4,leftstick:b6,leftx:a1,lefty:a0~,misc1:b0,paddle2:b1,paddle3:b3,x:b7,y:b10,hint:!SDL_GAMECONTROLLER_USE_BUTTON_LABELS:=1,\n```\n\nJoy-Con (R)\n```\n05006ea07e0500000720000001800000,Nintendo Switch Joy-Con (R),crc:a06e,platform:Linux,a:b1,b:b2,guide:b9,leftshoulder:b4,leftstick:b10,leftx:a1~,lefty:a0,paddle1:b5,paddle3:b7,rightshoulder:b6,start:b8,x:b0,y:b3,hint:!SDL_GAMECONTROLLER_USE_BUTTON_LABELS:=1,\n```\n\nAlso mapped pressing the sticks, which was wrong for the left one.\n\nUnfortunately, testcontroller does not recognize SL and SR of the left Joy-Con for some reason...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4606539300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651010025","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4651010025","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4651010025,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFTjH6Q","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T16:15:51Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T16:15:51Z","body":"Possibly related\n- #78805","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651010025/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651249020","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119817#issuecomment-4651249020","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119817","id":4651249020,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFTxtfA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T16:43:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T16:43:32Z","body":"SDL (and Godot) has an HIDAPI joystick driver for JoyCons that understand their specific input/output packet format, so by enabling it the controllers should work as expected (the PR that fixed the issue you linked enables the HIDAPI driver to be compiled in Godot, but it may not be enough in case of Linux, see the issue I linked below), but I think having them work correctly without it should be looked into as well!\nSee also https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/issues/14407 , this issue might explain why the HIDAPI driver hasn't been used in your case yet! :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651249020/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]